4420   36E3             ; ============================================================================
4421   36E3             ; TRANZ 330 STANDALONE 10-OBJECT ASTRONOMY FRONT END + GENERIC ENGINE
4422   36E3             ; Uses math/RTC primitives from TRANZ330_JUPITER_FIXED_V1_PATCHED above.
