5951   42BE 38 2A               JR C,G_PMP_WAN_CRES
5952   42C0             G_PMP_NEW:
5953   42C0 21 90 5F            LD HL,GPRN_PHASE_NEW
5954   42C3 C3 69 41            JP G_PRN_PRINT_Z
5955   42C6             G_PMP_WAX_CRES:
